    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kilou Gideon Ŋimidian ka kinyaŋa ŋakiro kec",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu nai ŋituŋa a ekabila a Epuraim tolimokis Gideon temasi, “Anukiro nu ŋuna itiya iyoŋ neni kosi? Kaanukiro pa ikinyaraa iyoŋ isua apaki ŋina ilosyo iyoŋ akitijikin Ŋimidian?” Apotu ikes kisiburata Gideon nooi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimok nai Gideon ikes tema, “Anukiro tokona etiyat ayoŋ ŋuna ikwaan ka ŋuna itiyato iyes? Tari kekudyoko ŋuna itiyato iyes ŋikilyok a ekabila a Epuraim, epolok ŋun nooi akilo ŋuna itiyato ŋituŋa a ateker ka Abieser. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Ekapolon ikipotok iyes Oreb ka Seeb ŋikarikok a ŋajorei a Ŋimidian. Anukiro etiyat ayoŋ ŋuna ikwaan ka ŋuna itiyato iyes?” Kedau Gideon akirwor ŋun, apotu ŋituŋa a ekabila a Epuraim tojoŋoto aŋoikinit iŋes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolot nai Gideon tari Yorodan, todoka ekekwaye aŋolol, kaapei ka ŋikilyok ŋamiae ŋauni ŋulu arukitotor iŋes, aupit ikes daadaŋ nai arubakinito ikes iwuapito Ŋimidian. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimok nai Gideon ŋituŋa a Sukos tema, “Inakisi kareca ŋamugati ŋadi neni a ŋirukitos kaŋ, anerae eupit ikes nooi ka ewuapitae isua Seba ka Salimuna ŋirukitos a Ŋimidian.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai tolimokis ŋikapolok a Sukos Gideon temasi, “Idau iyoŋ akikamun Salimuna ka Seba ikiŋisit isua ŋamugati aŋuna a ŋasigarya kon a?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toboŋok Gideon ikes tema, “Ejok! Ani kedau Ekapolon akipotokin Seba ka Salimuna napedor kaŋ, ekebuŋae ayoŋ iyes a ŋalita a ŋuna eya ŋikukwa a ŋuna elemunitae analoŋisat.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Gideon toloto a nen ka ŋirukitos keŋ Penuel, kilip Gideon ŋituŋa a Penuel daŋ ŋamugati ŋadi aŋuna a ŋirukitos keŋ lopite ŋolo elipitor ŋituŋa a Sukos, ido apotu ŋituŋa a Penuel daŋ toboŋokis iŋes lopite ŋolopei aboŋokinitotor ŋituŋa a Sukos. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, tolimok Gideon ikes tema “Ani aboŋuni ayoŋ kedau akiloun ŋimoe kaŋ, amunaari ayoŋ aduketait ŋina aoyan na.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki ŋin ayakasi Salimuna ka Seba kaapei ka ŋasigarya kec Karikor ka aapiyarit ekimar a ŋasigarya kec ŋalipyo ŋatomon ka ŋakan, arae ikes ŋipiya a ajore a ŋikabilae a ŋulu alo Kide, anerae aponi toarae ŋikajiok ŋalipyo amiat ka ŋatomoniarei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai Gideon kitipeiyo tomek erot ŋolo emeto ŋikawotok ŋolo itorit Kide Noba ka Yogibea, kitijik Gideon ajore a Salimuna ka Seba, kituumik ikes pa etenito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toema Salimuna ka Seba, kiwuap Gideon ikes, todita ŋirwosi a Ŋimidian ŋuluarei ŋul Seba ka Salimuna, kitubul ajore kec daadaŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani eboŋuni Gideon lokoku a Yoas alojie, kitoru lorot ŋolo itipeiyorere Eres. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kikamu Gideon esorokit epei ŋolo a Sukos, kiŋitiŋiti iŋes tolimo ŋirorwa a ŋikapolok ka ŋikasikou a Sukos daadaŋ. kigir nai Gideon ŋirorwa a ŋikapolok ka ŋikasikou a Sukos, arae ikes daadaŋ ŋituŋa ŋatomonikanikaarei ka ŋikanikaarei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Todolu nai Gideon neni aya ŋituŋa a Sukos, tolimok ikes tema, “Seba ka Salimuna ikes lu, akoloŋit ŋina eŋitar ayoŋ akimuj aŋuna a ŋasigarya kaŋ ka ŋamugati aŋuna kec, ipotu iyes towout ainakin ayoŋ ŋamugati ka akimuj, ido temasi, ‘Idau iyoŋ akikamun Salimuna ka Seba, ikiŋisit isua ŋamugati aŋuna a ŋasigarya kon a ŋuna eupit a?’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai Gideon tolemu ŋalita ŋuna aya ŋikukwa ŋuna alemunitae analoŋisat kibuŋaere ŋikapolok a ŋituŋa a Sukos. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu daŋ iŋes toritak kwap aduketait ŋina aoyan ŋina a Penuel ka toar ŋikilyok daadaŋ ŋulu ke etaun a ŋol.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiŋit Gideon Salimuna ka Seba tema, “Ataŋae ekwaanatar ŋikilyok ŋulu iarete iyes alo Tabor? ” Toboŋokis ikes temasi, “Ekwaan ikes ka iyoŋ, atakanete ikes esibito ŋidwe a erwosit.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema nai Gideon neni kec, “Arae ikes ŋikaitotoi kaŋ, ŋidwe a toto kaŋ, ikwapei eyarya Ekapolon, ani kerae nyiyarito iyes ikes pa kakaar ayoŋ iyes.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimok nai Gideon Yeser lokoku keŋ ŋolo kiyae tema, “Ape, toar ikes!” Nai abu idya nyeut ekileŋ keŋ, akuryana iŋes, anerae ariŋa iŋes erae idya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Temasi nai Salimuna ka Seba neni a Gideon “Bua toarae isua, anerae iyakar iyoŋ agogoŋu ŋina a ekile.” Aŋun abu Gideon toar Salimuna ka Seba, ido tolema ŋiboro ŋulu etanapikinitae lomosiriŋin a ŋikaala kec.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kilip Gideon neni a ŋakujo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimokis nai Ŋisirael Gideon temasi, “Kipukae isua, iyoŋ ka lokoku kon ta lopapait kon daŋ, anerae ikiu iyoŋ isua anapedor a ŋina a Ŋimidian.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimok Gideon ikes tema, “Nyekepukae ayoŋ iyes ka nyikipukae iyes lokoku kaŋ, Ekapolon iŋes ikipukae iyes.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema nai Gideon neni a Ŋisirael, “Kimyekinae ayoŋ ekeŋit iyes daadaŋ ŋakiro nu; inakinae ayoŋ ŋinapen ŋulu enapyo anaki ŋulu iŋatunete iyes aneni a Ŋimidian.” (Ayakatar Ŋimidian ŋinapito a ŋaki ŋulu etiyaunitae a egolid, anerae arae etal a Ŋimidian anapit ŋiboro ŋul ikwa Ŋisimael.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toboŋokis ŋituŋa temasi, “Ikiinakinio isua iyoŋ ŋiboro ŋul emam akitiŋakin.” Aponi nai topetakinae anaŋga kwap, tocakak ŋinituŋanan nanaŋg ŋin ŋinapito a ŋaki ŋulu keŋatunete ikes aneni a Ŋimidian. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae apotis a egolid a ŋolo etiyaunitere ŋinapito a ŋaki a ŋulu abu Gideon kirirau alotuŋa ŋakiloi ŋuna aapikinito ŋatomoniarei, (Pa emaritae ŋinapen a ŋidokolei, a ŋaki ka ŋilowi ŋulu kipura-Areŋak ŋulu enapeneneete ŋirwosi a Ŋimidian ka ŋulu anapito ŋikaala kec.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Gideon kitiyau etorube a akuj a egolid a ŋol, kiwuak lotaun keŋ Opura, ido apotu Ŋisirael daadaŋ kilipa neni a etorube. Apotu ŋun kitojamakis Gideon ka ekal keŋ akikinyomit Akuj. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu Ŋisirael kilout Ŋimidian ka ŋitijikino nabo Ŋimidian Ŋisirael. Abu ekisil toyakaun nakwap a Ŋisirael ŋikaru ŋatomoniomwon alokaru a ŋulu ayarya Gideon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Atwanare a Gideon",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Yerubaal lokoku a Yoas tolot akiboi alokai keŋ a elope. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki ŋin ayakar Gideon ŋidwe ŋulusapa ŋatomonikanikaarei, ŋulu auruuni iŋes elope anerae ayakar iŋes ŋaberu ŋuna alalak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu aberu keŋ daŋ ŋina pa eisitae ŋina eboi alo Sekem kidou ikoku ŋinisapat, tolimok ekiro Abimelek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai Gideon lokoku a Yoas totwana emojoŋit nooi, tonukae iŋes neni anukitae papa keŋ Yoas alo Opura alotaun a Ŋiabieseri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
